category: Devel
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libstdc++6 zlib0
sdesc: "Z80, 8080 and Z180 assembler"
ldesc: "zasm accepts source code using 8080 and Z80 syntax and can
convert 8080 syntax to Z80. It can generate binary files, Intel Hex or Motorola
S19 files, and specialized files for Sinclair and Jupiter Ace and .tzx tape
files."

